```console
$ scherzo-cloud workflow continue --help
Continue selected steps of a local workflow run

Usage: scherzo-cloud workflow continue [OPTIONS] --from <NODE> <RUN_DIR>

Arguments:
  <RUN_DIR>  Directory containing the workflow run

Options:
      --from <NODE>            Ordinary step to reexecute (repeatable)
      --workflow <FILE>        Replacement workflow file within the run's original source root
      --execution-root <PATH>  Existing execution root; defaults to the previous attempt's root
      --plain                  Force plain human presentation
      --json                   Print the workflow result as JSON
      --color <WHEN>           Select renderer color behavior [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
  -h, --help                   Print help

Select one or more ordinary steps with --from. Their downstream ordinary dependents run again; other eligible ordinary steps are inherited. Every finalizer runs again. The original run inputs and Git baseline remain authoritative.

```
